(4272330, 615982, 57202, '<td valign="top">* Clears throat *  RIBBON!!! :)  Spectacular photograph!  Not only does this perfectly meet the challenge, but it is crisp and visually appealing.  I wouldn''t even classify this one as a "flower shot". ;)  Well done!</td>', '* Clears throat *  RIBBON!!! :)  Spectacular photograph!  Not only does this perfectly meet the challenge, but it is crisp and visually appealing.  I wouldn''t even classify this one as a "flower shot". ;)  Well done!', '2007-11-28 00:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272333, 617185, 29011, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot. Not sure how to vote with two main colors seems to be split into three. With the blue, orange/red and green. All three are competing.</td>', 'I really love this shot. Not sure how to vote with two main colors seems to be split into three. With the blue, orange/red and green. All three are competing.', '2007-11-28 00:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272335, 615595, 79955, '<td valign="top">I feel that your Dragonfly subject is not too suitable nor appealing enough for this challenge. Get closer also- 4</td>', 'I feel that your Dragonfly subject is not too suitable nor appealing enough for this challenge. Get closer also- 4', '2007-11-28 00:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272336, 617311, 29011, '<td valign="top">I sure do love it! Purple and Yellow, great choice for this shot.</td>', 'I sure do love it! Purple and Yellow, great choice for this shot.', '2007-11-28 00:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272338, 617429, 79955, '<td valign="top">nice abstract - 6</td>', 'nice abstract - 6', '2007-11-28 00:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272344, 617486, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the background and lighting. For the vase, wouldn''t it be cool if it where a glass one, filled with blue water? ;)</td>', 'Really like the background and lighting. For the vase, wouldn''t it be cool if it where a glass one, filled with blue water? ;)', '2007-11-28 00:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272347, 617249, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused on the drop -7</td>', 'Nicely focused on the drop -7', '2007-11-28 00:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272351, 616963, 20168, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition and colors though you''ve chosen three colors, including two complimentary (red/green) plus yellows and browns which may devalue this photo among DPC literalists. I''ll stick with my 8.</td>', 'beautiful composition and colors though you''ve chosen three colors, including two complimentary (red/green) plus yellows and browns which may devalue this photo among DPC literalists. I''ll stick with my 8.', '2007-11-28 00:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272353, 617373, 57202, '<td valign="top">I know some on this site will probably vote this down for its content, but I think this is an excellent artistic piece.  I love that EVERYTHING else in the frame complements the purple socks.  Not only that, but this has a very vintage feel to it.  Quite frankly, I like it!</td>', 'I know some on this site will probably vote this down for its content, but I think this is an excellent artistic piece.  I love that EVERYTHING else in the frame complements the purple socks.  Not only that, but this has a very vintage feel to it.  Quite frankly, I like it!', '2007-11-28 00:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
