(4272957, 616205, 77425, '<td valign="top">nice, clear macro, but the color of the rust, to me, is orange, which needs a blue background.</td>', 'nice, clear macro, but the color of the rust, to me, is orange, which needs a blue background.', '2007-11-28 06:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
