(4273844, 616924, 86825, '<td valign="top">I played around with this concept, too, I actually have an old picture that I took a while ago with crayons and colored pencils like this, I think it works really well for this challenge</td>', 'I played around with this concept, too, I actually have an old picture that I took a while ago with crayons and colored pencils like this, I think it works really well for this challenge', '2007-11-28 13:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
