(4273918, 615709, 44877, '<td valign="top">Yes, dark and out of focus.</td>', 'Yes, dark and out of focus.', '2007-11-28 13:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4273924, 615652, 44877, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this. Very inspired and awesome photo. Great high contrast. However, I''m not seeing how it fits the challenge. Since I don''t vote down for dnmc''s, I won''t vote at all. In another challenge this would have been the bomb.</td>', 'Absolutely love this. Very inspired and awesome photo. Great high contrast. However, I''m not seeing how it fits the challenge. Since I don''t vote down for dnmc''s, I won''t vote at all. In another challenge this would have been the bomb.', '2007-11-28 13:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4273926, 617028, 44877, '<td valign="top">What a refreshing variation of the one thousand pepper shots.</td>', 'What a refreshing variation of the one thousand pepper shots.', '2007-11-28 13:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4273932, 617013, 44877, '<td valign="top">Nice  - beautiful colors and great still life.</td>', 'Nice  - beautiful colors and great still life.', '2007-11-28 13:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4273940, 616273, 44877, '<td valign="top">This image would have benefited from some post processing, such as levels, brightness/contrast, hue/saturation.</td>', 'This image would have benefited from some post processing, such as levels, brightness/contrast, hue/saturation.', '2007-11-28 13:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4273953, 617518, 44877, '<td valign="top">I like your strange processing on this photo. Makes it look like poster art - very cool.</td>', 'I like your strange processing on this photo. Makes it look like poster art - very cool.', '2007-11-28 13:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274106, 617078, 85981, '<td valign="top">Very eye catching image of such a simple subject.</td>', 'Very eye catching image of such a simple subject.', '2007-11-28 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274113, 616533, 87097, '<td valign="top">Great shot, two thumbs up 9/10</td>', 'Great shot, two thumbs up 9/10', '2007-11-28 15:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274118, 616541, 15711, '<td valign="top">YAY - the first ornament.  I love the composition.</td>', 'YAY - the first ornament.  I love the composition.', '2007-11-28 15:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274164, 617486, 62671, '<td valign="top">I really like the color scheme and the texture in the background.  <br/>The lighting is good.   The composition feels a little to tall.  It needs a few smaller objects to create a grouping and a visual triangle. <br/>Good Job!</td>', 'I really like the color scheme and the texture in the background.  The lighting is good.   The composition feels a little to tall.  It needs a few smaller objects to create a grouping and a visual triangle. Good Job!', '2007-11-28 15:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274180, 616390, 62671, '<td valign="top">A very unique view of someones money.  I don''t recognize the patterns so I am assuming its not American. I''m curious about which country it is. <br/>The texture and abstract feel is very cool.   The diamond maze makes me want to follow them.  You got the complimentary colors very nicely in an out of the box image.  The cut off letters hurts the image somewhat compositionally.  I wonder if it would be better with just the O maybe turned sideways to emphasize the wavey red lines. Good Job!</td>', 'A very unique view of someones money.  I don''t recognize the patterns so I am assuming its not American. I''m curious about which country it is. The texture and abstract feel is very cool.   The diamond maze makes me want to follow them.  You got the complimentary colors very nicely in an out of the box image.  The cut off letters hurts the image somewhat compositionally.  I wonder if it would be better with just the O maybe turned sideways to emphasize the wavey red lines. Good Job!', '2007-11-28 15:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274191, 617413, 50231, '<td valign="top">Nice one brotha! :-D <br/> <br/>Comment only...</td>', 'Nice one brotha! :-D  Comment only...', '2007-11-28 16:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274205, 617324, 62671, '<td valign="top">Very cool reflections of reflections.</td>', 'Very cool reflections of reflections.', '2007-11-28 16:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274209, 616374, 62671, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, dof, and focus.  The moon even looks great! Good Job!</td>', 'Nice colors, dof, and focus.  The moon even looks great! Good Job!', '2007-11-28 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274219, 616901, 62671, '<td valign="top">I have that bottle!  Very nice image.  I like the bevel on the mirror giving some distortion to the reflection.  I''m not real fond of the yellow color cast on the entire image.  The more I look at it, the more its growing on me.  But I think its going to hurt the outcome.  Clone out the white splotches on the background for future use.</td>', 'I have that bottle!  Very nice image.  I like the bevel on the mirror giving some distortion to the reflection.  I''m not real fond of the yellow color cast on the entire image.  The more I look at it, the more its growing on me.  But I think its going to hurt the outcome.  Clone out the white splotches on the background for future use.', '2007-11-28 16:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4274221, 617428, 77543, '<td valign="top">The complementary colour is not clear.</td>', 'The complementary colour is not clear.', '2007-11-28 16:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
