(4277928, 617307, 81382, '<td valign="top">Thought about doing this myself but with some more in the fore/background with some DOF effects going on. This is nice and simple and the two colours are well balanced, well composed. The blueish looking shadow is a bit odd</td>', 'Thought about doing this myself but with some more in the fore/background with some DOF effects going on. This is nice and simple and the two colours are well balanced, well composed. The blueish looking shadow is a bit odd', '2007-11-30 08:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277931, 617332, 81382, '<td valign="top">Not focussed enough unfortunately. This could have worked really well, I reckon lose the hand and match and do this macro with focus on an area of the blue gas jets and then large amount of DOF either side.</td>', 'Not focussed enough unfortunately. This could have worked really well, I reckon lose the hand and match and do this macro with focus on an area of the blue gas jets and then large amount of DOF either side.', '2007-11-30 08:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277936, 617413, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great colour balance, too many pictures I have seen while voting so far have had a dull and bright colour where as here, the blue and orange seem matched. Not sure I like the motion blur on the foot but the face is in focus which is the main thing and the background is uncomplicated</td>', 'Great colour balance, too many pictures I have seen while voting so far have had a dull and bright colour where as here, the blue and orange seem matched. Not sure I like the motion blur on the foot but the face is in focus which is the main thing and the background is uncomplicated', '2007-11-30 08:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277940, 617405, 81382, '<td valign="top">The blue doesn''t seem strong enough to match the intensity of the orange. Also the orange and blue fade into one another so you lose that high contrast element you get from strong adjacent complementary colours. Well composed thogh and the silhouette is well defined</td>', 'The blue doesn''t seem strong enough to match the intensity of the orange. Also the orange and blue fade into one another so you lose that high contrast element you get from strong adjacent complementary colours. Well composed thogh and the silhouette is well defined', '2007-11-30 08:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277943, 616691, 81382, '<td valign="top">Just a shame the eyes aren''t a touch sharper. Normally in this situation you would aim to have the eyes in focus and little else, but it might have been worth considering using a smaller appature to get the hat in focus since its orange colour is important here.</td>', 'Just a shame the eyes aren''t a touch sharper. Normally in this situation you would aim to have the eyes in focus and little else, but it might have been worth considering using a smaller appature to get the hat in focus since its orange colour is important here.', '2007-11-30 08:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277947, 617222, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely strong red/orange tones set on top of the blue background gives the strong contrast this challenge demands. The left hand side exhibits this quality more so than the right and the road is not important and does nothing for composition; so keeping the best bits by cropping into the tree tops and sky on the left hand side would have simplified the image, put focus on the colour contrast, cleaned up the composition and more detail in the leaves/branches would be visible.</td>', 'Lovely strong red/orange tones set on top of the blue background gives the strong contrast this challenge demands. The left hand side exhibits this quality more so than the right and the road is not important and does nothing for composition; so keeping the best bits by cropping into the tree tops and sky on the left hand side would have simplified the image, put focus on the colour contrast, cleaned up the composition and more detail in the leaves/branches would be visible.', '2007-11-30 08:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277948, 617477, 81382, '<td valign="top">The orange fades into the blue and so you lose the strong constrast effect of having two complementary colours adjacent to one another which is a shame as its a lovely sky.</td>', 'The orange fades into the blue and so you lose the strong constrast effect of having two complementary colours adjacent to one another which is a shame as its a lovely sky.', '2007-11-30 08:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278011, 617403, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but I wish the green were a bit more prominent.</td>', 'Very pretty, but I wish the green were a bit more prominent.', '2007-11-30 09:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278078, 615830, 87205, '<td valign="top">I love the way you put it together!</td>', 'I love the way you put it together!', '2007-11-30 10:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278082, 616259, 83375, '<td valign="top">time to clean that sensor!</td>', 'time to clean that sensor!', '2007-11-30 10:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278085, 615652, 83375, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2007-11-30 10:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278086, 615709, 63503, '<td valign="top">Blue and Red?</td>', 'Blue and Red?', '2007-11-30 10:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278087, 617467, 83375, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2007-11-30 10:23:51.000000', NULL, 1);
