(4278096, 617257, 83375, '<td valign="top">Great color and sharpness, but the composition is awkward....I think it would be more appealing if the subject was more up and to the left to show more of the glass and to put the lemon slice in the upper left quadrant.</td>', 'Great color and sharpness, but the composition is awkward....I think it would be more appealing if the subject was more up and to the left to show more of the glass and to put the lemon slice in the upper left quadrant.', '2007-11-30 10:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278196, 616885, 84736, '<td valign="top">the angle and dof are good, but i think it would be a little stronger if the whole plate was in the shot.</td>', 'the angle and dof are good, but i think it would be a little stronger if the whole plate was in the shot.', '2007-11-30 12:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278210, 616876, 87160, '<td valign="top">This must have taken some time you must be pleased with the result...</td>', 'This must have taken some time you must be pleased with the result...', '2007-11-30 12:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278219, 617299, 78652, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to this photo.</td>', 'Nice feel to this photo.', '2007-11-30 12:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278224, 617424, 15207, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I don''t see complimentary colours here and hte image seems a little soft (unfocused). One techique you can use is to employ a shutter speed that is higher than the longest focal length of your lens. Therefore, if you''re using an 80mm lens, then shoot at 1/125th of a second or higher. The higher the shutter speed the better... and sometimes a tripod helps.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I don''t see complimentary colours here and hte image seems a little soft (unfocused). One techique you can use is to employ a shutter speed that is higher than the longest focal length of your lens. Therefore, if you''re using an 80mm lens, then shoot at 1/125th of a second or higher. The higher the shutter speed the better... and sometimes a tripod helps.', '2007-11-30 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278229, 616242, 84736, '<td valign="top">would have been better with a whiter background, but very cute</td>', 'would have been better with a whiter background, but very cute', '2007-11-30 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
