(4278553, 615501, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I would suggest using a program like Noise Ninja or Neat Image to clean up that ISO noise in the background though!</td>', 'Very cute!  I would suggest using a program like Noise Ninja or Neat Image to clean up that ISO noise in the background though!', '2007-11-30 16:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
