(4279254, 616541, 65234, '<td valign="top">Simple and lovely.  Great lighting on the ornament.</td>', 'Simple and lovely.  Great lighting on the ornament.', '2007-11-30 23:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279846, 617373, 52130, '<td valign="top">random</td>', 'random', '2007-12-01 04:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279974, 616573, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely strong contrasting colours. Well composed. Not much detail on the stamen, if thats the right word, and this is where your focus is and so the image as a whole looks a little out of focus. If there had been a bit of mist on them to bring out a bit of sparkle and detail then that would have given the whole image a real boost.</td>', 'Lovely strong contrasting colours. Well composed. Not much detail on the stamen, if thats the right word, and this is where your focus is and so the image as a whole looks a little out of focus. If there had been a bit of mist on them to bring out a bit of sparkle and detail then that would have given the whole image a real boost.', '2007-12-01 07:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279976, 617139, 81382, '<td valign="top">The other non-complementary colours are a bit of a distraction. This seems more blue/red to me rather than blue/orange which could have easily been changed during PP</td>', 'The other non-complementary colours are a bit of a distraction. This seems more blue/red to me rather than blue/orange which could have easily been changed during PP', '2007-12-01 07:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279978, 617360, 81382, '<td valign="top">Just not quite as sharp in the centre of the flower head as it could be. This might have just been because of the image size reduction to 640 for the entry - always worth doing one final USM before submission and I think this would have helped here. Nicely balanced colours though</td>', 'Just not quite as sharp in the centre of the flower head as it could be. This might have just been because of the image size reduction to 640 for the entry - always worth doing one final USM before submission and I think this would have helped here. Nicely balanced colours though', '2007-12-01 07:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279980, 616954, 81382, '<td valign="top">The shadow is too unconventional for me I''m afraid. This idea of the shadow self portrait would have worked against a plain/uncomplicated background, but then you wouldn''t have the complementary colours and shadows are not known for their colour.</td>', 'The shadow is too unconventional for me I''m afraid. This idea of the shadow self portrait would have worked against a plain/uncomplicated background, but then you wouldn''t have the complementary colours and shadows are not known for their colour.', '2007-12-01 07:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279981, 617213, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, good contrasting colours. Well composed, nice and simple, should do well</td>', 'Nice and sharp, good contrasting colours. Well composed, nice and simple, should do well', '2007-12-01 07:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279985, 617213, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice and cheery; unique subject and good color contrast.</td>', 'Nice and cheery; unique subject and good color contrast.', '2007-12-01 07:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279986, 617509, 81382, '<td valign="top">Focus is just on the fringe and slightly off on the eyes which kills this for me. Whites of eyes have a red colour cast, lipstick on teeth and multiple catch lights on eyes. Green colour is not of the same order of saturation as the red and so is a little unbalanced. Well composed though. Questionable border - would have been better to have used the same green colour as the average green in the image rather than RGB 0, 255, 0</td>', 'Focus is just on the fringe and slightly off on the eyes which kills this for me. Whites of eyes have a red colour cast, lipstick on teeth and multiple catch lights on eyes. Green colour is not of the same order of saturation as the red and so is a little unbalanced. Well composed though. Questionable border - would have been better to have used the same green colour as the average green in the image rather than RGB 0, 255, 0', '2007-12-01 07:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279988, 617364, 81382, '<td valign="top">The blue is simply not strong enough to be complementary to the orange hues. Interesting aspect ratio</td>', 'The blue is simply not strong enough to be complementary to the orange hues. Interesting aspect ratio', '2007-12-01 07:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279990, 616159, 81382, '<td valign="top">Difficult to quite make out what the main subject is and the title is not giving much away. Lovely green hues take up more area of the image than the red, but you still achieve colour balance by saturating the red a lot more so thats very good.</td>', 'Difficult to quite make out what the main subject is and the title is not giving much away. Lovely green hues take up more area of the image than the red, but you still achieve colour balance by saturating the red a lot more so thats very good.', '2007-12-01 07:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279991, 617013, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like this for not being just pretty!  The shapes in the composition are pleasing to me, and the lighting is good, but it''s your choice of subject I like best.  The dying bananas and the climbing (purple potato?) vine are a nice contrast to make your point, and the colors work well enough together for the challenge.</td>', 'I like this for not being just pretty!  The shapes in the composition are pleasing to me, and the lighting is good, but it''s your choice of subject I like best.  The dying bananas and the climbing (purple potato?) vine are a nice contrast to make your point, and the colors work well enough together for the challenge.', '2007-12-01 07:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279992, 617390, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely bokeh :-)  Very festive feel to this.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely bokeh :-)  Very festive feel to this.', '2007-12-01 07:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279993, 615625, 81382, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you''ve done this, not overly keen on it to be honest. The top half of the image looks more yellow on my display than orange and so is struggling a bit to complement the blue</td>', 'Not sure how you''ve done this, not overly keen on it to be honest. The top half of the image looks more yellow on my display than orange and so is struggling a bit to complement the blue', '2007-12-01 07:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279994, 617307, 65234, '<td valign="top">Clever positioning of the peppers, I must say.  By far the best of the many pepper shots in this challenge, and one of the better shots overall.</td>', 'Clever positioning of the peppers, I must say.  By far the best of the many pepper shots in this challenge, and one of the better shots overall.', '2007-12-01 07:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279996, 615595, 81382, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharpness and detail which is enhanced by having a neutral background. The blue takes up a lot more area than the orange but you achieve balance well by ensuring that the orange is more heavily saturated so thats very well done. The only thing that is a bit questionable is the relatively elaborate border which distracts from some of the detail on the dragon fly.</td>', 'Excellent sharpness and detail which is enhanced by having a neutral background. The blue takes up a lot more area than the orange but you achieve balance well by ensuring that the orange is more heavily saturated so thats very well done. The only thing that is a bit questionable is the relatively elaborate border which distracts from some of the detail on the dragon fly.', '2007-12-01 07:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279999, 615561, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors!  I like the lines of the dock and the positioning of the fisherman in the shot.  I might crop it quite a bit tighter on top; although that one cloud or vapor trail is kind of pointing to the fisherman, it disturbs the harmony of the scene for me.</td>', 'Lovely colors!  I like the lines of the dock and the positioning of the fisherman in the shot.  I might crop it quite a bit tighter on top; although that one cloud or vapor trail is kind of pointing to the fisherman, it disturbs the harmony of the scene for me.', '2007-12-01 07:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280000, 617403, 65234, '<td valign="top">Um, pretty image, but what exactly are you drinking that''s green?</td>', 'Um, pretty image, but what exactly are you drinking that''s green?', '2007-12-01 07:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280001, 617470, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice, bright color contrast.</td>', 'Nice, bright color contrast.', '2007-12-01 07:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280002, 616544, 65234, '<td valign="top">::groan:: Very punny.  Shot is certainly original :-)  A little bright, but that''s OK with the subject.</td>', '::groan:: Very punny.  Shot is certainly original :-)  A little bright, but that''s OK with the subject.', '2007-12-01 08:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280003, 617407, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice find; quite an unusual-looking bug.</td>', 'Nice find; quite an unusual-looking bug.', '2007-12-01 08:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280004, 617257, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice color contrast, and looks rather refreshing, besides.</td>', 'Very nice color contrast, and looks rather refreshing, besides.', '2007-12-01 08:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
