(4280006, 616854, 65234, '<td valign="top">Perfectly timed capture, and very nice shade of blue to complement your orange.  This looks like it should do very well.</td>', 'Perfectly timed capture, and very nice shade of blue to complement your orange.  This looks like it should do very well.', '2007-12-01 08:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280007, 617152, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, and I like the pastels complementing each other quietly.  A nice change from some of the in-your-face color contrasts.</td>', 'Nice detail, and I like the pastels complementing each other quietly.  A nice change from some of the in-your-face color contrasts.', '2007-12-01 08:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280008, 615518, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice macro; pretty purples set off the yellow naturally without being overdone.</td>', 'Nice macro; pretty purples set off the yellow naturally without being overdone.', '2007-12-01 08:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280009, 616760, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail; the green is a bit muddy on my monitor in contrast to the brightness of the red.  Not sure I find it complementary, exactly, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice detail; the green is a bit muddy on my monitor in contrast to the brightness of the red.  Not sure I find it complementary, exactly, but still a nice shot.', '2007-12-01 08:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280010, 616030, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely image; colors and scene look very serene.</td>', 'Lovely image; colors and scene look very serene.', '2007-12-01 08:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280011, 615731, 65234, '<td valign="top">Just noticed the bug!  Like the DOF to bring out the detail on the greenery.</td>', 'Just noticed the bug!  Like the DOF to bring out the detail on the greenery.', '2007-12-01 08:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280012, 616982, 81382, '<td valign="top">Very dark, would have lost the ball things as then unbalance the composition. This looks more like red/blue rather than orange/blue on my display which is a shame. The red is much stronger than the blue and so further adds to the unbalance. Red tones are visible as reflections in the blue glass which is nice but hasn''t worked the other way around - so more unbalance. Apart from the reflection, the blue and red are in the main, seperated from one another by the background and so you lose the high contrast attained from having complemenary colours against one another</td>', 'Very dark, would have lost the ball things as then unbalance the composition. This looks more like red/blue rather than orange/blue on my display which is a shame. The red is much stronger than the blue and so further adds to the unbalance. Red tones are visible as reflections in the blue glass which is nice but hasn''t worked the other way around - so more unbalance. Apart from the reflection, the blue and red are in the main, seperated from one another by the background and so you lose the high contrast attained from having complemenary colours against one another', '2007-12-01 08:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280014, 616758, 65234, '<td valign="top">Colors and subject are fun; I might have moved the cup off to the side of the composition a bit, or tilted the whole thing just to add a bit more interest to the composition.</td>', 'Colors and subject are fun; I might have moved the cup off to the side of the composition a bit, or tilted the whole thing just to add a bit more interest to the composition.', '2007-12-01 08:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
