(4283366, 617257, 23002, '<td valign="top">One of the best I have seen so far.  Excellent concept, great colours.  Makes me thirsty. 10</td>', 'One of the best I have seen so far.  Excellent concept, great colours.  Makes me thirsty. 10', '2007-12-02 18:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
