(4288240, 617446, 62318, '<td valign="top">Interest pose and I think it works well. Not sure about the green cast, but I am guessing it was intentional to correspond with the red? Tough call on that one. I do like the various textures you are using.</td>', 'Interest pose and I think it works well. Not sure about the green cast, but I am guessing it was intentional to correspond with the red? Tough call on that one. I do like the various textures you are using.', '2007-12-04 12:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4288243, 617440, 62318, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I like the color combinations of the purple and yellow. I also like how the feet are on the toes. One thing I think might help to bring it up a notch would be maybe having one sock all the way up on just one foot and/or having one foot flat on the heel. This way you can get some nice tension between the repetition. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I like the color combinations of the purple and yellow. I also like how the feet are on the toes. One thing I think might help to bring it up a notch would be maybe having one sock all the way up on just one foot and/or having one foot flat on the heel. This way you can get some nice tension between the repetition. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-04 12:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
