(4289920, 617311, 76430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by keibo84:</b></div><hr/><i> so hmmm, how do i get my new comments to appear on that "Photographer''s Comments" box up there?? I''ve seen it done by other people, please let me know, thanks </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Go to your picture and click the line that says "Edit the details of image".  Edit the Photographer''s Comments then click Submit Changes.<br/>Congratulations!  Great shot.  Ummm...what is it?</td>', 'Originally posted by keibo84: so hmmm, how do i get my new comments to appear on that "Photographer''s Comments" box up there?? I''ve seen it done by other people, please let me know, thanks  Go to your picture and click the line that says "Edit the details of image".  Edit the Photographer''s Comments then click Submit Changes.Congratulations!  Great shot.  Ummm...what is it?', '2007-12-05 00:55:06.000000', NULL, 0),
