(4289956, 615652, 53814, '<td valign="top">If nothing else, perhaps you have learned, that, when someone asks you "What color is the snow?", or "What color is a night sky void of stars?", you will not be expected to answer, since there are no colors to describe those conditions. So, you have learned something valuable from this challenge, and that is what DPC is all about. Great shot.</td>', 'If nothing else, perhaps you have learned, that, when someone asks you "What color is the snow?", or "What color is a night sky void of stars?", you will not be expected to answer, since there are no colors to describe those conditions. So, you have learned something valuable from this challenge, and that is what DPC is all about. Great shot.', '2007-12-05 01:08:36.000000', NULL, 0),
