(4291107, 617407, 68035, '<td valign="top">Coooooooool macro Roz and the electric blue of the insects head (are they naturally that colour in Oz or did you spray paint it? ;-) ) goes brilliantly with the gentler pastels of the flowers<br/> <br/>As ever the dof and sharpness are just bang on.<br/> <br/>Another great shot from a great photographer</td>', 'Coooooooool macro Roz and the electric blue of the insects head (are they naturally that colour in Oz or did you spray paint it? ;-) ) goes brilliantly with the gentler pastels of the flowers As ever the dof and sharpness are just bang on. Another great shot from a great photographer', '2007-12-05 08:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291119, 617106, 68035, '<td valign="top">Karen, this was my favourite of the many leaf shots in the challenge.  Super filled frame and a shot that conveys both the strength and fragility of plant life.  Love the way the green is bleeding into the red like ink spilled on a tissue<br/> <br/>Cracking sharpness too</td>', 'Karen, this was my favourite of the many leaf shots in the challenge.  Super filled frame and a shot that conveys both the strength and fragility of plant life.  Love the way the green is bleeding into the red like ink spilled on a tissue Cracking sharpness too', '2007-12-05 08:44:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291129, 617299, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well given your score range went from 6.5432 to 2.0000 it looks like about half the literalists were on holidays!<br/> <br/>The thing I really like about your images generally is that they are just so out there, no compromise to try and garner votes just shots that YOU like, which is why I guess your score tends to be either at the top end of the range or towards the lower end<br/> <br/>Guess it was a bit harsh for my taste (but remember I am old and dull) but I really liked what you were going for and the fact that the red and green was so vibrant and in your face</td>', 'Well given your score range went from 6.5432 to 2.0000 it looks like about half the literalists were on holidays! The thing I really like about your images generally is that they are just so out there, no compromise to try and garner votes just shots that YOU like, which is why I guess your score tends to be either at the top end of the range or towards the lower end Guess it was a bit harsh for my taste (but remember I am old and dull) but I really liked what you were going for and the fact that the red and green was so vibrant and in your face', '2007-12-05 08:48:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291132, 617324, 64929, '<td valign="top">Way to go, Irene!!!  Excellence as usual!<br/>I sure hope you''re feeling better, dear friend.  Take Care!<br/>((HUGS))</td>', 'Way to go, Irene!!!  Excellence as usual!I sure hope you''re feeling better, dear friend.  Take Care!((HUGS))', '2007-12-05 08:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291136, 615652, 48471, '<td valign="top">Midhun (?), it''s a great photo and I hope you don''t mind the placement and those funny votes. I don''t have any of those ribbons that other people give away, but I have some beer (or wonderful merlot, if that''s your choice), so that''s what I can offer you as a recognition for this good work. As for the outakes, they''re good also, but with these kind of photos I like when there is a direct look, a stare, which means I really liked the bottom right one. And you should have left the hat on his head even for this shot. I think...</td>', 'Midhun (?), it''s a great photo and I hope you don''t mind the placement and those funny votes. I don''t have any of those ribbons that other people give away, but I have some beer (or wonderful merlot, if that''s your choice), so that''s what I can offer you as a recognition for this good work. As for the outakes, they''re good also, but with these kind of photos I like when there is a direct look, a stare, which means I really liked the bottom right one. And you should have left the hat on his head even for this shot. I think...', '2007-12-05 08:51:15.000000', NULL, 0),
