(4292036, 617324, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Whoa!  Awesome again, Irene.   Does it ever get "Ho Hum. . .another ribbon"  :)    Nahhhhh. . . .I bet not :)<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS once again!!!!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Sandy,<br/>No way is it "ho Hum" (as you know ;-) And today it was like a Godsend because I was feeling like hell.<br/>Thanks to everyone for the get well wishes. I''m slowly starting to feel normal again (or as normal as I''ll ever be ;-D<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Whoa!  Awesome again, Irene.   Does it ever get "Ho Hum. . .another ribbon"  :)    Nahhhhh. . . .I bet not :) CONGRATULATIONS once again!!!!!!   Hi Sandy,No way is it "ho Hum" (as you know ;-) And today it was like a Godsend because I was feeling like hell.Thanks to everyone for the get well wishes. I''m slowly starting to feel normal again (or as normal as I''ll ever be ;-D', '2007-12-05 12:19:22.000000', NULL, 0),
