(4292578, 617324, 50578, '<td valign="top">When I seen the 3rd place shot for this challenge  I thought there goes Irene again.   Wow was I shocked when I seen your name under this one instead.  Nice Job.  very crispy photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-05 14:27:00.</i></td>', 'When I seen the 3rd place shot for this challenge  I thought there goes Irene again.   Wow was I shocked when I seen your name under this one instead.  Nice Job.  very crispy photo.', '2007-12-05 14:25:12.000000', '2007-12-05 14:27:00.000000', 0),
