(4302869, 616122, 68797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Techo:</b></div><hr/><i> Apologies if you have tooken offense over my during voting comment.<br/>Meant no offense, but the color of the can itself does look more blue than purple on my screen. Not disputing the color of the paint on the flowers.I tried some slight color adjustment on the Blues and a little did go a long way. Congratulations on making the top10. It''s one of my favorites from the challenge which easly made my top5 :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>you''re right about the can. when I bought the wrapping foil (which is around the can) it looked purple, but when I took the outer foil it was packed in off, it turned out to be blue. I was bummed by it but couldn''t go back to return it.</td>', 'Originally posted by Techo: Apologies if you have tooken offense over my during voting comment.Meant no offense, but the color of the can itself does look more blue than purple on my screen. Not disputing the color of the paint on the flowers.I tried some slight color adjustment on the Blues and a little did go a long way. Congratulations on making the top10. It''s one of my favorites from the challenge which easly made my top5 :)   you''re right about the can. when I bought the wrapping foil (which is around the can) it looked purple, but when I took the outer foil it was packed in off, it turned out to be blue. I was bummed by it but couldn''t go back to return it.', '2007-12-09 07:34:10.000000', NULL, 0),
